			"Message": "build(Output): bump semver from 7.8.0 to 7.8.1\n\nUpdate the semver devDependency to the latest patch release.\n\nChangelog: https://github.com/npm/node-semver/compare/v7.8.0...v7.8.1",
			"SHA": "7500e5877a7d7079a53aadd3adfa634197dde3cf"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
